#: ../../tools/pharmacodb_tools.rst:81 1a00cf9cafc3489ba41cdc0844bb365f
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a cancer cell line from "
"PharmacoDB, including tissue of origin, disease annotations, dataset-"
"specific synonyms, and accession IDs. Look up by cell line name or "
"PharmacoDB cell ID. PharmacoDB harmonizes cell line identifiers across 10"
" pharmacogenomics datasets. Example: get details for MCF-7 breast cancer "
"or A549 lung cancer cell line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pharmacodb_tools.rst:88 6d776795d6e04780972b4767c5622e6d
